<title>CANADA: Westcoast raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Westcoast raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westcoast Energy Inc said Wednesday its board increased the gas pipeline company's quarterly dividend by C$0.03 a share to C$0.29.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable December 31 to shareholders of record December 6.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314</p>
